house-prologue: {"desk":{"r":"used","target":"lhome","label":"p_look","lines":["n_hero: Zoé's board for the Water Office: a pin for every house waiting for the project's heat. Ours is near the top."]},"trunk":{"r":"used","target":"lhome","label":"p_look","lines":["n_hero: The old travel trunk. Desert Island, Zeelich... these days it holds seed packets."]},"mend":{"r":"used","target":"lhome","label":"p_look","lines":["n_hero: Things to take back: Gilbert's kettle, the baker's scales. Gilbert will want the kettle before he wants to say thanks."]},"meter":{"r":"used","target":"lhome","label":"p_look","lines":["n_hero: The heat meter. Not connected yet. Zoé got us on the list."]},"bench":{"r":"used","target":"lhome","label":"p_look","lines":["n_hero: Arthur's paddle boat, built to beat Lulu's. The plan says \"rudder needs pin (pliers?)\". So that's where my pliers went."]}}
